## 1.9 GraphNodeIdToDocMap - ID 映射机制

### 1.9.1 为什么需要 ID 映射？

在 Lucene 中，每个文档有一个 `docId`，但：
- 不是所有文档都有向量字段
- `docId` 在段合并后会改变
- jVector 图节点使用连续的 `ordinal`（0, 1, 2, ...）

```
示例场景:

文档写入:
  Doc 0: { "title": "A", "vector": [0.1, 0.2] }  → ordinal 0
  Doc 1: { "title": "B" }                        → 无向量
  Doc 2: { "title": "C", "vector": [0.3, 0.4] }  → ordinal 1
  Doc 3: { "title": "D", "vector": [0.5, 0.6] }  → ordinal 2

映射关系:
  ordinal 0 → docId 0
  ordinal 1 → docId 2
  ordinal 2 → docId 3

搜索时:
  jVector 返回 ordinal 1 是最近邻
  需要转换为 docId 2 返回给 Lucene
```

### 1.9.2 GraphNodeIdToDocMap 的实现

```java
public class GraphNodeIdToDocMap {
    // 双向映射
    private int[] graphNodeIdsToDocIds;  // ordinal → docId
    private int[] docIdsToGraphNodeIds;  // docId → ordinal

    // 构造函数：从 ordinal→docId 数组创建
    public GraphNodeIdToDocMap(int[] graphNodeIdsToDocIds) {
        this.graphNodeIdsToDocIds = graphNodeIdsToDocIds.clone();

        // 构建反向映射
        int maxDocId = Arrays.stream(graphNodeIdsToDocIds).max().getAsInt();
        this.docIdsToGraphNodeIds = new int[maxDocId + 1];
        Arrays.fill(docIdsToGraphNodeIds, -1);

        for (int ord = 0; ord < graphNodeIdsToDocIds.length; ord++) {
            int docId = graphNodeIdsToDocIds[ord];
            if (docId != -1) {
                docIdsToGraphNodeIds[docId] = ord;
            }
        }
    }

    // 搜索时使用：ordinal → docId
    public int getLuceneDocId(int graphNodeId) {
        return graphNodeIdsToDocIds[graphNodeId];
    }

    // 过滤时使用：docId → ordinal
    public int getJVectorNodeId(int luceneDocId) {
        return docIdsToGraphNodeIds[luceneDocId];
    }
}
```

### 1.9.3 段排序时的映射更新

当 Lucene 对段进行排序（例如按时间戳排序）时，`docId` 会重新分配：

```java
public void update(Sorter.DocMap sortMap) {
    int[] newGraphNodeIdsToDocIds = new int[graphNodeIdsToDocIds.length];
    int[] newDocIdsToOrdinals = new int[maxNewDocId + 1];
    Arrays.fill(newDocIdsToOrdinals, -1);

    for (int oldDocId = 0; oldDocId < docIdsToGraphNodeIds.length; oldDocId++) {
        int ord = docIdsToGraphNodeIds[oldDocId];
        if (ord == -1) continue;

        // 获取新的 docId
        int newDocId = sortMap.oldToNew(oldDocId);

        // 更新映射
        newDocIdsToOrdinals[newDocId] = ord;
        newGraphNodeIdsToDocIds[ord] = newDocId;
    }

    this.docIdsToGraphNodeIds = newDocIdsToOrdinals;
    this.graphNodeIdsToDocIds = newGraphNodeIdsToDocIds;
}
```

## 1.10 I/O 适配层

### 1.10.1 为什么需要适配层？

jVector 库定义了自己的 I/O 接口：
- `RandomAccessReader`：随机读取
- `IndexWriter`：顺序写入

而 Lucene 使用：
- `IndexInput`：输入流
- `IndexOutput`：输出流

适配层负责桥接这两套接口。

### 1.10.2 JVectorIndexWriter - 写入适配

```java
public class JVectorIndexWriter implements IndexWriter {
    private final IndexOutput indexOutputDelegate;  // Lucene 的输出流

    public JVectorIndexWriter(IndexOutput delegate) {
        this.indexOutputDelegate = delegate;
    }

    @Override
    public void writeInt(int v) throws IOException {
        indexOutputDelegate.writeInt(v);  // 直接委托
    }

    @Override
    public void writeFloat(float v) throws IOException {
        // float 转 int 位模式再写入
        indexOutputDelegate.writeInt(Float.floatToIntBits(v));
    }

    @Override
    public long position() throws IOException {
        return indexOutputDelegate.getFilePointer();
    }

    // ... 其他方法类似
}
```

### 1.10.3 JVectorRandomAccessReader - 读取适配

```java
public class JVectorRandomAccessReader implements RandomAccessReader {
    private final IndexInput indexInputDelegate;  // Lucene 的输入流

    @Override
    public void seek(long offset) throws IOException {
        indexInputDelegate.seek(offset);
    }

    @Override
    public int readInt() throws IOException {
        return indexInputDelegate.readInt();
    }

    @Override
    public void readFully(byte[] bytes) throws IOException {
        indexInputDelegate.readBytes(bytes, 0, bytes.length);
    }

    // Supplier 模式：支持多线程并发读取
    public static class Supplier implements ReaderSupplier {
        private final IndexInput currentInput;

        @Override
        public RandomAccessReader get() throws IOException {
            // 克隆输入流，每个线程独立的读取位置
            IndexInput clone = currentInput.clone();
            return new JVectorRandomAccessReader(clone);
        }
    }
}
```

